sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Chat UI sidebar
    participant AG as Agent
    participant MCP as MCP server

    UI->>AG: GET /api/agent/mcp/info
    AG->>MCP: initialize
    MCP-->>AG: name "blog", instructions, capabilities
    AG->>MCP: tools/list
    MCP-->>AG: list_posts, search_posts, get_post, create_post, update_post, publish_post, unpublish_post, delete_post
    AG->>MCP: resources/list
    MCP-->>AG: blog://posts
    AG->>MCP: resources/templates/list
    MCP-->>AG: blog://posts/{post_id}
    AG->>MCP: prompts/list
    MCP-->>AG: draft_blog_post, review_post
    AG-->>UI: {server_url, model, tools, resources, resource_templates, prompts}
